# Search-tool ignore file (ripgrep, fd, VS Code search).

#

# NOT a .gitignore -- git never reads this, so it can never affect commits.

# Everything already in .gitignore is skipped by ripgrep automatically;

# only the gaps belong here.

#

# Use `rg --no-ignore` to search these anyway.

pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json

# Go module cache / build artifacts under cli/.

cli/vmui-cli
cli/vmui-cli.exe

\*\*/drizzle/meta/
